}</code></pre>
            Select the Turret in the Scene view. What does Unity draw, and why is this tool invaluable for game designers?</li>
            <li>Tune <code>maxAttackRange</code>: What radius feels challenging without being frustrating? Write down your preferred number and explain your reasoning.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="checklist">
        <h3>Checkpoint — before moving on, you must be able to:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Break down autonomous entity awareness into target acquisition and distance testing</li>
            <li>Explain why caching references in <code>Start()</code> is superior to calling <code>FindWithTag</code> in <code>Update()</code></li>
            <li>Use <code>Vector3.Distance</code> inside an <code>if</code> condition</li>
            <li>Create <code>TurretController.cs</code> and attach it to a scene GameObject</li>
